                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On March 14, in a statement to the People’s Chamber of the “German Democratic
                    Republic”, Grotewohl rejected the
                    conditions for elections which had been proposed by the Federal Republic. For
                    the text of his statement, see Grotewohl,
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Im Kampf um DDR</hi>, pages 335–356; extracts are also printed in <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Documents on German Unity</hi>, volume I, pages
                    186–191.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
